Steps to Operate Gallery
It enables the users to view and edit pictures and videos.
1.From the Home screen, Select Menu icon as displayed in the following screenshot:

2.Click Gallery icon  to view pictures and videos. It displays the following screen:

Pictures (1): It displays the list of pictures stored in your gallery.
3.Click Videos tab (2): to view the list of videos stored in your gallery.
4.Click Favourites tab (3) to view the list of pictures and videos saved in the favorite folder in your gallery.
5.Click Recent tab (4) to view the list of pictures and videos which are recently captured.
6.Click Suggested tab (5) to view the list of suggested images, GIFs, videos.
7.Click Grid tab (6) to modify the display panel of your gallery.
8.Click + icon (7) to select the lists of pictures and videos to create a new movie.
9.Click Search icon (8) to view desired pictures or videos.
10.Click Vertical Ellipsis icon (9) to create additional functions.
11.Click > Vertical Ellipsis > Camera > Edit > Select all > Share > Create GIF > Create collage > Slideshow > Recycle bin > Settings.
Albums (10): It displays the list of folder categories in your gallery.
Stories (11): It automatically converts pictures and videos into a memorable collection.
Shared (12): It displays the list of pictures and videos shared with other contacts or devices.

